---
description: Frontend implementation standards
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.ts", "**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Build polished, production-quality frontend UI.

- Reuse components when appropriate.
- Use semantic design tokens instead of random values.
- Design desktop and mobile intentionally.
- Include polished hover/focus states.
- Maintain accessibility.
- Prefer simple implementations over unnecessary abstractions.

Do not sacrifice visual quality just because the UI is functional.